 downvote. it registers in your tags. then i remove my vote. presto! you''re the only one keeping it here!", "put in brackets", "hollywood hits", "new generations", "new generations philip glass", "compilatie", "celtic celebration", "leaving on a jet plan", "bflaminio", "ronak bhatt", "special purpose", "alabama thunderpussy", "dfree843", "cdnnnow128", "tag spam", "va - we were first - 180 hits in their original versions (2014)", "boot land", "s.a. souvenirs", "mugwart was a sludge/punk/doom/hardcore band from virginia beach", "active 1998\u20132002. emerging from the tidewater crust\u2011punk/skate scene", "the group combined punk urgency and hardcore aggression with downtuned sludge heaviness and doom atmosphere. their raw", "abrasive sound placed them firmly within the late\u20111990s/early\u20112000s underground", "while maintaining a distinctly punk ethos. the band\u2019s definitive release is discography (this dark reign recordings", "tdr\u201113", "usa)", "which compiles studio material from 1999\u20132002. tracks were originally issued (or intended) across several small\u2011label documents: \u201cbefore you / fallen\u201d \u2014 acrude records (crude\u201101", "france)", "7\u2033 single. because sometimes two are better than one \u2014 split with fistula", "shifty records (sh09", "3\u2033 cd. south of hell \u2013 14 songs from the new south \u2014 berserker records (ber\u2011005", "compilation. crushers killers destroyers! \u2014 shifty records (sh08", "compilation. doomed \u2014 this dark reign recordings (tdr\u2011001", "compilation. mugwart performed throughout virginia and the surrounding region", "sharing stages with grief", "damad", "fistula", "sofa king killer", "and clutch. in 2011", "uk extreme\u2011metal band dragged into sunlight selected mugwart\u2019s track \u201cfallen\u201d for a curated mixtape in terrorizer magazine (issue #285)", "highlighting the group\u2019s ongoing resonance nearly a decade after disbanding. legacy: though short\u2011lived", "mugwart is regarded as a cult", "foundational act of the virginia sludge/punk/doom underground. their recordings circulate digitally via bandcamp and streaming platforms", "and their influence continues to be cited by later generations of extreme bands. disambiguation: this is mugwart (virginia beach", "mugwart (has nothing to do with (\u201cmugwort\u201d)", "needs to be removed", "sludge hardcore punk", "ansage", "country dreams"]', NULL, NULL, '2026-05-23 17:03:45', 1, 'Various Artists', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "artist_enrichment" VALUES('Flesh World', '70e1af98-dcfc-4769-8086-ace65c7fb175', 'US', NULL, '[]', '[]', NULL, NULL, '2026-05-23 23:55:16', 3, 'Flesh World', '["punk", "post-punk", "hardcore", "noise", "america"]', '1. FLESH WORLD: LIAM O, LIAM H, JARED S, JAMES W.  2. San Francisco, CA’s Flesh World plays ice-soaked punk rock led by dark and infectious guitar flourishes and a just-under-the-surface pop sensibility. Featuring band members who are all veterans of the DIY punk scene — from bands including Limp Wrist, Brilliant Colors, Needles, and more — Flesh World brings influences from a host of punk sub-genres together, calling to mind the tense moodiness of classic British post punk', '5181', '63180', 'https://www.last.fm/music/Flesh+World');
