INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "artist_enrichment" VALUES('Hushpuppy', 'fc23e696-d1b6-4417-a99b-150ffcd803f1', NULL, NULL, '[]', '["furry"]', NULL, NULL, '2026-05-24 00:00:30', 1, 'Hushpuppy', '[]', 'HUSHPUPPY is the solo passion project of Zoë Brecher, a NYC-based musician. Although she is a multi-instrumentalist, she is best known for her work as a drummer and has played with notable artists such as Bruce Springsteen, Sad13, Sammus, Kalbells, King Tuff, Sasami, Palehound, Oberhofer, Total Slacker and many others. She has also performed numerous times on late-night TV shows. In 2023, Zoë was the guest drummer for a week with the 8G band on Late Night with Seth Meyers.', '4881', '17152', 'https://www.last.fm/music/HUSHPUPPY');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "artist_enrichment" VALUES('Hennessy', 'fd117307-b25f-41e7-89a0-23f37be2e249', 'US', NULL, '[]', '[]', 'Jas Hennessy & Cie., commonly known simply as Hennessy (French pronunciation: [ɛnɛsi]), is a French producer of cognac, founded in 1765 by Richard Hennessy which has its headquarters in Cognac, France.', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hennessy', '2026-05-24 00:00:31', 1, 'Hennessy', '["rap", "hip hop", "rnb", "rhode island", "memphis"]', 'There are at least four artists who use the name Hennessy.  1. Bay Area hip hop producer & MC check out album herehttp://hennessy.bandcamp.com/album/hennessy-and-the-beat-machine   2.An electro and techno producer and DJ based in Glasgow, Scotland, UK. Website here: www.myspace.com/hennessy  3. A hip-hop artist from Memphis, Tennessee, USA.  4. HENNESSY is a Japanese hard rock trio from Hiroshima, Japan. http://www.audioleaf.com/hennessy', '13482', '54884', 'https://www.last.fm/music/Hennessy');
