INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "artist_enrichment" VALUES('Koudede', '7e9d3899-9de2-4741-973c-6147238bb2f1', 'NE', NULL, '[]', '["tuareg rock", "tishoumaren", "niger", "agadez", "desert blues", "assouf"]', NULL, NULL, '2026-05-24 00:01:18', 3, 'Koudede', '["desert blues", "niger", "tuareg", "world", "african"]', 'Koudede est né à Agadez et à grandit à Arlit, dans le Nord du Niger, entre les contreforts du massif  de l’Aïr et les sables du Sahara, dans la poussière des mines d’uranium… ses  grands-parents le cachent quand les autorités veulent enregistrer les enfants pour les scolariser… Il n’ira jamais à l’école…  En 1990, quand après un carnage, les touaregs prennent les armes et les pick-up pour affronter les pouvoirs centraux au Mali et au Niger.', '20251', '102598', 'https://www.last.fm/music/Koudede');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "artist_enrichment" VALUES('Palms', '9c651ba1-59d3-4772-9fed-cd233af44465', 'US', 2012, '[]', '["post-metal", "alternative rock", "alternative metal"]', 'Palm most commonly refers to:', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Palms', '2026-05-24 00:01:19', 7, 'Palms', '["post-rock", "Post-Metal", "experimental", "indie", "electronic"]', 'There are 4 bands with this name:  1)  Palms is an American rock band that formed in 2011. The group features Deftones vocalist Chino Moreno and three members of the post-metal band Isis: bassist Jeff Caxide, drummer Aaron Harris and guitarist Bryant Clifford Meyer.  2) Palms is composed of Nadja Korinth and Ryan Schaefer.  They reside in NYC and Berlin.  They are on Rare Book Room Records.  3) An indie rock band from Sydney, Australia.  4) An indie rock band from Tempe, Arizona formed in April of 2012.', '95279', '1314627', 'https://www.last.fm/music/Palms');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "artist_enrichment" VALUES('Wet Lips', '34370d8b-6cd6-457b-baf1-580df77d6884', 'AU', 2012, '[]', '[]', NULL, NULL, '2026-05-24 00:01:19', 5, 'Wet Lips', '["industrial metal", "punk", "australia", "industrial", "all girl punk band"]', 'There have been two bands going by the name Wet Lips.  1.) Wet Lips were an industrial metal band based in  Budapest, Hungary. Formed in August 2007 by singer Estendor Lin and bassist Amola Love on the ashes of a former metal band called Sumne Malus, they gained notable attention in the Budapest underground.   After a year of playing in a failed alternative metal band, Lin and Amola decided they would try themselves at something new. They began experimenting with an electronic sound', '1081', '10981', 'https://www.last.fm/music/Wet+Lips');
