short\u2011lived", "mugwart is regarded as a cult", "foundational act of the virginia sludge/punk/doom underground. their recordings circulate digitally via bandcamp and streaming platforms", "and their influence continues to be cited by later generations of extreme bands. disambiguation: this is mugwart (virginia beach", "mugwart (has nothing to do with (\u201cmugwort\u201d)", "needs to be removed", "sludge hardcore punk", "ansage", "country dreams"]', NULL, NULL, '2026-05-23 23:45:12', 1, 'Various Artists', '[]', 'Warning! Deleting this artist may remove other artists and scrobbles from your library - please handle this with caution!  Note: You can view albums tagged as ''Various Artists'' in your library here.   The term Various Artists is used in the recording industry to designate releases featuring contributions from multiple performers. It commonly appears on compilation albums or collaborative recordings where no single artist attribution applies. On digital platforms such as Last.', '394823', '3784611', 'https://www.last.fm/music/Various+Artists');
