INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "artist_enrichment" VALUES('Chicos de Nazca', 'ba8ede85-444c-4702-a373-5c3f618bac97', 'CL', 2010, '[]', '["psychedelic rock", "neo-psychedelia"]', NULL, NULL, '2026-05-24 00:09:20', 1, 'Chicos de Nazca', '["Psychedelic Rock", "indie", "shoegaze", "chile", "chilean"]', 'Chicos de Nazca is a neo-psychedelic band from Santiago de Chile, based in Berlin, formed in 2010 by Francisco "Kb" Cabala from the bands La Hell Gang and Cindy Sisters.  Members during the years: Kb Cabala, Carlos Cabala, Martin Avendaño, Juan Pablo Rodriguez, Nes Rodriguez, Pablo Thiermann.', '7625', '107129', 'https://www.last.fm/music/Chicos+de+Nazca');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "artist_enrichment" VALUES('Hissyfit', '94268096-57b3-4c3b-9fde-676f6790bc43', NULL, NULL, '[]', '[]', NULL, NULL, '2026-05-24 00:09:21', 1, 'Hissyfit', '["riot grrrl", "punk", "punk rock", "queer", "queercore"]', 'There are more artists under the name Hissyfit  1) hissyfit  was a all girl band that formed in auckland in 2009 they broke up in 2011. The trio slam through short songs about no doz, hair ties and meeting girls. they list there influences as riot grrrl, post punk, 60''s girl bands. h http://www.facebook.com/pages/hissyfit/120704837942763.  2) An all-girl indiepop band from Melbourne, who released an EP "Stars without Make-up" in 2001.  3) Hissyfit is the pseudonym of LA-based singer and model Augusta Gail', '1213', '7893', 'https://www.last.fm/music/Hissyfit');
